iwtd.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E4%BE%B5%E8%9A%80%E6%9C%AF.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/a/ac/4aqi6xj1ccd3jru3zarzanov1naiwtd.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E4%BE%B5%E8%9A%80%E6%9C%AF.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/a/ac/4aqi6xj1ccd3jru3zarzanov1naiwtd.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />侵蚀术\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>1\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>远程、对单位、直击\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>1-3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓8-↑8\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓0-↑0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（魔法伤害）单体攻击，造成<font color=\"#d68fe2\">85%</font>伤害，对目标施加随机<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"2级属性减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">2级属性减益</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-3 0.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/02/m4gv8o4dpxzc7r9lpuzb4xhyp1ivq98.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-3_0.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/0